Routine has:
block routine (the same flow, but other script)
subroutine (parallel flow, any code)

Events chain:
start event after event (1)
start subroutine after event (2)
start event after subroutine end (3)



Event:
Routine onFire(funtion) --creates subroutine and run it (2)
Routine onCancel(funtion) --creates subroutine and run it (2)
Routine onEnd(funtion) --creates subroutine and run it (2)
Timer after(double) (1)

Event global related:
Timer timer(double)



Routine:
Routine onFinish(function) => routine.FinishEvent.onFire
Routine onCancel(function) => routine.FinishEvent.onCancel
Routine onEnd(function) => routine.FinishEvent.onEnd
Event after(double) (3)

Routine global related:
void run("path/to/script")
Routine subroutine(function) --creates subroutine and run it 
Routine subroutine("path/to/script") --shortcut for subroutine(function do run("path/to/script") end)



Branch:
Event onWinner(event/routine) --fire if event/routine won, cancel in other case

Breanch global related:
Branch race(event/routine...)
